<title>USA: U.S. may challenge News Corp-Heritage Media deal.</title>
<headline>U.S. may challenge News Corp-Heritage Media deal.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Justice Department may challenge News Corp.'s plans to acquire Heritage Media Corp. in a $1.35 billion stock-and-debt transaction, the two companies said on Monday.</p>
<p>The department's antitrust field office in San Francisco has recommended that the department challenge the deal, the companies said in a joint press release.</p>
